 "statement": "For any short-Weierstrass E/F_p with p>3 and odd prime rational order r>=5, the monic anti-Frobenius x-kernel polynomial satisfies K(x(P))=-psi_2(P)psi_h(P)/psi_(h+1)(P), h=(r-1)/2, for every nonidentity rational P."
